2026-09-01 → 2026-09-30 · amortized basis · sent 2026-10-03

Frozen at approval on 2026-10-02. No restatement of spend, change of exchange rate, edit of a billing rule or rename can change what this document says.
Delivery: succeeded, 1/1 recipient on 2026-10-03

LINE        KIND         COLLECTED    ADJUSTMENT  SUBTOTAL     RATE     INVOICED   
Platform    cost centre  1000.00 USD  100.00 USD  1100.00 USD        —  1100.00 USD
Data        cost centre  1000.00 EUR           —   100.00 EUR   1.0800   108.00 USD
JP account  account      1000.00 JPY  100.00 JPY  1100.00 JPY  no rate  1100.00 JPY

  total      1208.00 USD + 1100.00 JPY

How this total was reached
  scope      Platform, prod (aws)
