  rates      1 EUR = 1.08 USD (stated 2026-09-01)
  rate date  2026-09-30
  warning    no exchange rate stated for JPY. Those amounts are carried in their own currency, and this invoice cannot be approved until a rate exists
  warning    2 scope entries no longer exist and contributed nothing
  corrects   an earlier, voided invoice (inv0)
  superseded by inv9

Billing
